Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.30,0:23:25.09,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(180,300)}不是今日的我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.09,0:23:28.26,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{=61}{\blur5\fad(180,300)}送給那一天的我 莉莉
